=== NOTES ===
Blocked Path notes (for follow-up prompts):

1. cmd/* heartbeat wiring (DEFERRED). The Heartbeater library
   ships in internal/worker/heartbeat.go but the cmd/notification-
   worker/main.go, cmd/export-worker/main.go, and
   cmd/automation-worker/main.go process entry points are OUTSIDE
   the allowed-files regex for this prompt and were not modified.
   Until a follow-up prompt wires worker.NewHeartbeater(store, opts).Start(ctx)
   into each main(), all three workers will display "Down" with
   the heartbeat_detail "no heartbeat received" in the UI. The
   panel handles this gracefully — failed/succeeded counts and
   queue depth still render from the Postgres aggregate.

2. Retry endpoint (DEFERRED per Out-of-scope). The prompt's
   "Retry failed" action was scoped out for this prompt; no retry
   button renders on the panel today. A future prompt could add
   a per-row retry on the drawer once an idempotent re-enqueue
   path lands in internal/notifier / internal/export /
   internal/automation.

Gate command quirk:
   Vitest 4.1.2 treats | literally inside --run "X|Y" filters
   so the gate's literal-pipe pattern matches zero files. The
   intended behaviour is positional filters, which works:
   
pm test -- --run QueueStatus useSystemQueues (used here).
   Same workaround documented in the phase-46/29-40 logs.
